  "body": "This is the home where you come for a day and stay for a lifetime which is what our vendors after 35 years have decided to do. It’s time to pass on the stunning views, space, sunshine and a lifestyle the whole family will love.\r\n\r\nFeatures and Benefits\r\n* Four bedrooms, three bathrooms\r\n* Multiple living areas\r\n* Multiple outdoor entertaining decks\r\n* Double garaging with internal access\r\n* Large under-house basement storage\r\n* Block & brick construction \r\n* Mature gardens and fruit trees\r\n* Excellent proximity to Mairangi village, beach, sporting facilities, regular public transport and motorway access\r\n* Zoned for Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College and double Westlake\r\n\r\n\r\nSet in one of Mairangi Bay's most sought-after pockets with incredible views over Tiritiri Matangi and Mairangi Bay Village, this substantial brick and block 1980’s family home is warm and welcoming. Designed with real family living in mind, there is room to spread out, entertain, relax and simply enjoy everything this exceptional coastal location has to offer.\r\n\r\nLovingly maintained and thoughtfully modernised, it gives the reassurance of an enduring build with the comforts and conveniences of modern day living. The layout is wonderfully flexible, adapting easily as your family grows and changes with four bedrooms, three bathrooms including ensuite and plenty of carparking. There's space to come together, and equally importantly, space to escape when a little peace and quiet is required. Multiple entertaining decks make the most of the elevated setting with it's ever changing vista, and give options for sunny breakfasts, relaxed family gatherings or summer evenings with friends from a private, rear deck stepping down to a generous garden where there's plenty of space for children to run and play. Multiple fruit trees and a thriving vege patch will delight the most avid of gardeners, and a large under-house basement, accessible via the garden or internally, is perfect storage of all your boys toys or a wine-cellar.\r\n\r\nThe location is an absolute bonus; not only are you within walking distance of Mairangi Bay Village, boutique shops, and the sparkling shores of Mairangi Bay beach, Mairangi Bay tennis, volleyball courts, and the Mairangi Bowling greens are equally handy for those active relaxers. The public transport on offer is probably the best on the north shore, only a 3 minute walk away with buses every 15 minutes, yet another tick on your wish-list. Schooling zoning is exceptional with some of the most highly sought-after schools on the North Shore in the mix and include Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College and double Westlake. \r\n\r\nThis is more than just a substantial family home. It's a place where children can grow, friends can gather, weekends can be spontaneous and everyday life can feel like a holiday. This is Mairangi Bay living at its very best. Come and see for yourself.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/CD6J",
